        "@value": "If a wall has a representative volume element which has a pattern which has a sparse pattern entity that is ‘headers bond units, then the value of MQI Wall Connections is equal to ‘1’ for vertical loads, ‘1.5’ for out of plane loads and ‘1’ for in plane loads."
